{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming' data-target='computer\/programming' data-title='Programming'>\r\n\t\t\tProgramming\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/programming\/wix' data-target='computer\/programming\/wix' data-title='WiX'>\r\n\t\t\tWiX\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on Notes: Get PrintEULA.dll.","label":"Notes","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/wix\/lauch_application_upon_finish","label":"Lauch application upon finish","url":"\/computer\/programming\/wix\/lauch_application_upon_finish"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/programming\/wix\/upgrade_support","label":"Upgrade Support","url":"\/computer\/programming\/wix\/upgrade_support"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t\t<div class='content-image-container'>\r\n\t<div class='cover-image cover-image-tile'>\r\n\t\t<img src='\/computer\/programming\/wix\/notes.svg' alt='Working notes on Notes: Get PrintEULA.dll.' style='object-fit: contain; object-position: center'>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<p class='cover-credit'>\n\t<span class='cover-credit-anchor'>\n\t\t<button type='button' class='cover-credit-toggle' aria-expanded='false' aria-label='Image credit'>\n\t\t\t<svg xmlns='http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16' width='14' height='14' aria-hidden='true' focusable='false'>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='8' r='6.25' fill='none' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.2'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<circle cx='8' cy='5.2' r='0.85' fill='currentColor'\/>\n\t\t\t\t<path fill='currentColor' d='M7.28 7.15h1.44v4.55H7.28z'\/>\n\t\t\t<\/svg>\n\t\t<\/button>\n\t\t<span class='cover-credit-popup'><span>Ujnotes<\/span> \u2014 <a class=\"content-link cover-credit-link\" href=\"https:\/\/creativecommons.org\/publicdomain\/zero\/1.0\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CC0 1.0<\/a><\/span>\n\t<\/span>\n<\/p>\n\n\t<h2 class='center'>Working notes on Notes: Get PrintEULA.dll.<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tIf modifying Sequence.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRename original by prefixing with c.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCWixUI_Mondo.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWixUI_Advanced.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCopy all .WXS files.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Get PrintEULA.dll<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>(Build from source.<\/strong> Src\\ext\\Wixui\\ .build).\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tRefer to the CustomAction Binary in a WXS file.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdd variables to wix project.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>First property group with &lt;name&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;DefineConstants&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>$(DefineConstants);<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>bannerBmp=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\Banner.bmp;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>dialogBmp=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\Dialog.bmp;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>exclamationIco=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\exclamic.ico;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>infoIco=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\info.ico;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>licenseRtf=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\License.rtf;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>newIco=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\new.ico;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>upIco=$(MSBuildProjectDirectory)\\Resource\\up.ico;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;DefineConstants&gt; &lt;\/DefineConstants&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>Error: ICE69 Mismatched component reference. Entry &lt;component&gt; references in different features<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdds \u2018Primary=yes\u2019 to \u2018componentRef\u2019 in feature.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tShould actually be referenced by multiple features.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThe one feature that has it will be the one actually installing it.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFirst disable ICE69 warning.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFeature@Absent=\"disallow\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTo keep a feature immutable.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Applicable even when not visible.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>Title (required) to be added explicitly.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\t*.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t<span id='date'>\r\n\t\t\t2026 Aug 19\t\t<\/span>\r\n\t<\/div>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div class='center' id='content-body-separator'><\/div>\r\n<div id='sub-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='fb_components'>\r\n\t<div class=\"fb-comments\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/wix\/notes\"\n  data-numposts=\"50\">\n<\/div>\n\t<div class=\"fb-like\"\n  data-href=\"https:\/\/ujnotes.com\/computer\/programming\/wix\/notes\"\n  data-layout=\"button\"\n  data-action=\"like\"\n  data-size=\"small\"\n  data-show-faces=\"false\"\n  data-share=\"true\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\r\n<div id='nav-list' class='center page-list'>\r\n\t<a id='nav-menu-prev'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/wix\/lauch_application_upon_finish' data-target='computer\/programming\/wix\/lauch_application_upon_finish' data-title='Lauch application upon finish' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - previous page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div class='arrow'>&#x25C4;<\/div><div>Lauch application upon finish<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-next'\r\n\t\t\tclass='XURL item_block_container' href='\/computer\/programming\/wix\/upgrade_support' data-target='computer\/programming\/wix\/upgrade_support' data-title='Upgrade Support' >\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image item_block_image_visible' src='\/resource\/placeholder.svg' loading='lazy' alt='Navigation - next page tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>Upgrade Support<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25BA;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t\t<\/a><a id='nav-menu-up' class='XURL item_block_container ' href='\/computer\/programming\/wix' data-target='computer\/programming\/wix' data-title='WiX'>\r\n\t\t<img class='item_block_image ' loading='lazy' src='\/computer\/programming\/wix.svg ' alt='Navigation - up level tile'><div class='item_block_text'><div>WiX<\/div><div class='arrow'>&#x25B2;<\/div><\/div>\r\n\t<\/a> <\/div>\r\n"}